        "code": "def sigmaPP(p: int, a: int) -> int:\n    if p == 1:\n        return a + 1\n    return (p ** (a + 1) - 1) // (p - 1)\n\n# Examples\nprint(sigmaPP(3, 2))  # 13\nprint(sigmaPP(5, 1))  # 6\nprint(sigmaPP(7, 3))  # 400",
