        "pseudocode": "function DetectPhase(branching, height_bounded):\n    if branching = \"finite\":\n        return NATURAL     // Finite Branching Collapse Theorem\n    if height_bounded:\n        return NATURAL     // Universal Collapse Theorem\n    return OMEGA_OR_BEYOND // Transfinite Escape Theorem\n\nComplexity: O(1)",
