        "name": "Sum of Divisors (\u03c3\u2081)",
        "pseudocode": "SIGMA_1(n):\n  total \u2190 0\n  for d from 1 to \u221an:\n    if d | n:\n      total \u2190 total + d\n      if d \u2260 n/d: total \u2190 total + n/d\n  return total\n\nTime: O(\u221an), Space: O(1)",
